WEBVTT

00:03:28.538 --> 00:03:31.079
The exact reason remains unclear,
but experts suspect

00:03:31.121 --> 00:03:34.413
that social interaction
gives our brain a mental workout.

00:03:34.454 --> 00:03:35.788
Just like muscle strength,

00:03:35.829 --> 00:03:39.288
we have to use our brain
or risk losing it.

00:03:39.329 --> 00:03:40.913
But don't despair.

00:03:40.954 --> 00:03:43.454
There are several steps you can take

00:03:43.496 --> 00:03:45.663
to aid your brain
in preserving your memories.

00:03:45.704 --> 00:03:47.538
Make sure you keep physically active.

00:03:47.579 --> 00:03:49.704
Increased blood flow
to the brain is helpful.

00:03:49.746 --> 00:03:51.038
And eat well.

00:03:51.079 --> 00:03:54.954
Your brain needs all the right nutrients
to keep functioning correctly.

00:03:54.996 --> 00:03:57.163
And finally, give your brain a workout.

00:03:57.204 --> 00:04:00.204
Exposing your brain to challenges,
like learning a new language,